                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8feeea43-92ca-3f1f-b70f-729106815c20",
                        "entry_id": "d69886d8-de74-39db-8366-4d5a15392ee9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to take away, to carry away (by vehicle)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e637f769-1b00-4e7e-9804-3419b9a54c06",
                                "sense_id": "8feeea43-92ca-3f1f-b70f-729106815c20",
                                "text": "— Образа́-то, ста́ло быть, Порфи́рий Влади́мирыч увёз?\n— Он увёз. Со́бственные, говори́т, ма́менькины образа́. И таранта́с к себе́ увёз, и двух коро́в.[...]",
                                "translation": "‘It was Porfiry Vladimirych who took the icons, I suppose?’\n‘Yes, he took them. “They’re Mother’s own icons,” he said. And he took the carriage as well and two of the cows…’",
                                "english": "‘It was Porfiry Vladimirych who took the icons, I suppose?’\n‘Yes, he took them. “They’re Mother’s own icons,” he said. And he took the carriage as well and two of the cows…’"
                            }
                        ]
